> I would be willing to work on providing a list of items

Oh, I just realized something. There's no reason not to include items
that help the student learn various aspects of the grammar and usage,
arranged as if in a complete course and introduced in order. These
could be taken straight out of the various existing tutorials and the
reference grammar. Then, the items could stand by themselves as a
course on lojban, and the problem of having to remember so many
different rules to start out with is no longer a problem. Vocabulary
could be interspersed with lessons on other aspects of the language. I
think I'll start some work on this. Any thoughts?

